# Frozen experiment samples are compared by sha256 across platforms.
#
# Several tests assert the exact byte hash of committed .jsonl baselines. Git's
# end-of-line normalisation rewrites CRLF to LF on checkout, which changes the
# hash: the same file hashed fc731efc... on Windows and b7201fe7... on Linux,
# and 23 tests failed only on CI. Marking these paths as binary disables the
# normalisation so the committed bytes are the checked-out bytes everywhere.
evaluation/experiments/**/*.jsonl -text
evaluation/phase*/*.jsonl -text
data/evaluation/*.jsonl -text
